sequenceDiagram
    participant U as Cliente (Frontend/API)
    participant BE as Backend
    participant N8N as n8n
    participant SC as Scanner Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant REP as Reports Service
    participant LAB as Juice Shop / DVWA

    U->>BE: POST /targets/{id}/pipeline
    BE->>DB: crear fila scan
    BE->>N8N: webhook trigger (scan_id, target_id, host)
    BE-->>U: 202 Accepted (no espera)

    Note over N8N: Resolve Pipeline Context<br/>(única lógica no-HTTP #1)

    N8N->>SC: POST /scan/nmap
    Note over SC: valida whitelist (C-13)<br/>antes de ejecutar
    SC->>LAB: nmap -sV -T4
    SC-->>N8N: resultado Nmap
    N8N->>BE: POST /scans/{id}/tasks (nmap)
    BE->>DB: normaliza -> services

    Note over N8N: Select HTTP Port<br/>(única lógica no-HTTP #2)

    N8N->>SC: POST /scan/whatweb
    SC->>LAB: whatweb
    SC-->>N8N: resultado
    N8N->>BE: POST /scans/{id}/tasks (whatweb)
    BE->>DB: normaliza -> technologies

    loop Nikto, Nuclei, ZAP (secuencial)
        N8N->>SC: POST /scan/{tool}
        SC->>LAB: ejecuta herramienta
        SC-->>N8N: resultado
        N8N->>BE: POST /scans/{id}/tasks ({tool})
        BE->>DB: normaliza -> findings + cve_references
    end

    N8N->>BE: POST /scans/{id}/complete
    N8N->>BE: POST /scans/{id}/reports?format=pdf
    BE->>REP: payload autocontenido (target+scan+findings)
    REP-->>BE: archivo generado
    BE->>DB: crear fila report

    U->>BE: GET /scans/{id} (polling)
    BE-->>U: status=completed
